 "note": "Every file copied into this lane, with the b-panel commit it came from. Files marked identical:false were modified for this lane; the modifications are listed in `changes` and described in DESIGN.md. `qman.py`, `DESIGN.md` and `HANDOFF.md` are new to this lane.",
 "source_worktree": "2026-09-17-b-panel",
 "source_branch": "exp/2026-09-17-b-panel",
 "source_commit": "25434a27bfc8857d81859784250b0bfd9a78adfd",
 "changes": {
  "panel.py": [
   "new module docstring for this lane",
   "import qman as QM",
   "declare_subjects: the `qman` family from qman_ranks x qman_variants, M = 4r, priority 3.5",
   "main: qranks / qman_maps and the assertion that qman_ranks needs pod_ranks",
   "main: the quadratic manifolds are fitted while the snapshot matrix is resident, into report[\"quadratic_manifold\"]",
   "build(): the `qman` branch -- GridBank([u_ref|V_r|W]) + qman.head, otherwise the POD branch verbatim",
   "the timed row carries `variant`",
   "DESIGN A1: per-rank initializer rule (48 through r=32, 96 only where points > 2D fails)",
   "DESIGN A1: bank-column and gamma-in-grid gates asserted in the driver, and a quad-vs-lin in-job field gate",
   "DESIGN A1: an untimed, OOM-tolerant representation floor for every qman arm",
   "DESIGN A1: the M-sensitivity and pre-declared ridge-sensitivity arms (qman_extra_M, qman_extra_gamma)"
  ],
  "audit_panel.py": [
   "`qman` added to reduced_fams and to the family sort order",
   "the per-arm row carries variant, bank_columns, quadratic_terms, the chosen ridge, the held-out error, the snapshot residuals and the trial-map description",
   "a qman_quad / qman_lin ladder beside the pod ladder",
   "DESIGN A1: the qman representation floor feeds best_found_percent; the quad-vs-lin gate is re-checked; the forced gamma, ||W||_F, held-out trajectory count and ridge trace are carried into the row"
  ],
  "smoke_panel.py": [
   "cut down to this lane: the 128-interval rule-TRANSFER half and the duplicate-rule-set gate removed (this lane runs one mesh with one rule set)",
   "qman.demo() and the quad-vs-lin gates added"
  ],
  "cluster/stage.py": [
   "lane directory, namespace qman_20260922, qman.py staged, FNO phase removed"
  ],
  "cluster/collect.py": [
   "lane directory and namespace; nothing excluded from the collection"
  ],
  "cluster/preserve_archive.py": [
   "lane directory"
  ],
  "config-256-qman.json": [
   "b-panel config-256.json trimmed to the endpoints plus the qman ladder; see DESIGN 3.1"
  ],
  "config-smoke64.json": [
   "b-panel config-smoke64.json trimmed to this lane plus the qman ladder"
  ],
  "qman.py (new)": [
   "DESIGN A1: the ridge holdout is by TRAJECTORY, not by snapshot column",
   "DESIGN A1: a non-finite gamma score can never win, and W is asserted finite",
   "DESIGN A1: the refit uses its own Gram scale; the Gram condition number is floored and its sign flagged; ||W||_F is recorded"
  ],
  "reports/generate_panel.py": [
   "REMOVED: b-panel's narrative generator is written around b-panel's own subject list and dies on a one-rung EQ ladder; replaced by reports/make_table.py"
  ]
 },
